{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:04e0821770abe94eec2dba70a2cbd94e4f5511798d1aff56b0fb593ab89824c2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962b1891e4a3fd84bc6f0f14e78c14772c70007df088275fa10ab258a25a4334",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●老大！\n刚才辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da8e7a3b79ae5090499e27a326ffaea024c5d9e7bb5af48f433cee068a6b513",
      "text": "忘年会，玩得太投入了，\n一眨眼就结束啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:149421dbeca140d3a73ea692f58a56bc9cfd33861040a16270c9755bc7ea0057",
      "text": "自从当了偶像之后，\n感觉每一天都过得飞快啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73dfe96847be13773f6350953ca29254aa57c6b958485bb633151b8b99713c6f",
      "text": "但是，在这一眨眼的时光里，\n塞满了好多好多的回忆！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ca99245e63221a6698aa6da0004fbf35fe72ab85ce5c66fe0b7d65b7ddf9083",
      "text": "忘年会直播的环节里，和大家聊起以往的活动时，\n俺就这么深深觉得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46e5087587ae2a321e547ff6915587dd1e8afd7d2ba596b3c0b5809fbc5048a0",
      "text": "明年也一起创造许多回忆吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c5dbad521280b654af93f9a66b7ee583f2b3b65a95425b8f81668c3b3b0d1d6",
      "text": "这是全力以赴过的证明呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e262d7769f0aa986fef60beae63c8ba29574bece948d78d85c89f6c7ecc1d5ae",
      "text": "那是当然啦！毕竟俺们可不是\n在这里就满足止步的时候啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8a70998a26a6d9a77a5d306b216325a1b0d92fc49852c7eb2c58191661afd3",
      "text": "肯定是的！明年俺也不能输给今年的俺，\n要全力送出满分的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afc1a6b8d802a1a4ed0306358f3ba07ae9831b34d0cd9624689ccc49c188f7f5",
      "text": "所以明年俺也希望老大能继续鼎力相助啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17356c872787af6ff016dba56e0cfd3abba4cd40ba6a02904c6df712450ff9d9",
      "text": "为了不辜负老大和所有粉丝的期待，\n俺自己也会加倍努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:042dai_403_2_4_042_03_09_a:2_4_042_03_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d55414c83e0955cfc6ebce978e42bd327fa6dc1b7079d8d0878323f2c7a0b7",
      "text": "再次谢谢你今年对俺的诸多关照啦。明年也\n拜托啦，老大！那就提前祝你新年快乐啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
